That's a great insight.

1205
01:09:36,020 --> 01:09:37,980
Totally transforms how you interpret that phrase.

1206
01:09:38,680 --> 01:09:42,490
Okay, and finally, a quick and easy exit when you're really in a hurry.

1207
01:09:42,740 --> 01:09:45,340
How about, sorry, I've gotta run, check in later.

1208
01:09:45,620 --> 01:09:46,100
Gotta run.

1209
01:09:46,140 --> 01:09:51,270
Yeah, gotta run is a common quick way to say I've gotta leave or I've gotta go quickly.

1210
01:09:51,310 --> 01:09:55,520
And check in later just means to contact or talk again at a later time.

1211
